  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local people for Discharge Monitoring as a Service - Zambesi river Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This feasibility study explores an innovative, affordable solution for river discharge monitoring using image-based technology. The project will develop a scalable monitoring service featuring a camera made entirely from do-it-yourself components. This cost-effective approach aims to improve flood and drought forecasting, enabling better decision-making and early warning systems in remote areas where traditional monitoring methods are impractical.</narrative>
  </description>
